          "width": 730,
          "height": 95,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Led redesign of the core platform used by 180K+ paying enterprise customers, reducing workflow completion time by 34%.\n• Built and launched scalable design system across 6 product squads, cutting new feature design-to-code cycle time by 45%.\n• Conducted 60+ generative user research interviews and usability labs with executive stakeholders and end users.\n• Mentored 4 associate product designers on design systems architecture and accessible typography.",
