          "y": 545,
          "width": 730,
          "height": 95,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Designed web and mobile experiences for fintech enterprise customers managing over $350M in monthly transactions.\n• Overhauled user onboarding flow from a 9-step questionnaire to interactive walkthrough, reducing drop-off friction by 28%.\n• Created comprehensive Figma component library with auto-layout, interactive variants, and automated token sync.\n• Collaborated closely with front-end engineers to ensure 100% fidelity in production React implementation.",
