        "visible": true,
        "text": "• Technical lead for 14 engineers owning the distributed multi-tenant storage plane holding 18PB across 6 AWS availability zones.\n• Designed and implemented asynchronous Raft consensus engine in Rust, cutting median state-machine commit latency from 8.4ms to 1.3ms.\n• Replaced legacy JSON-over-HTTP internal gateways with gRPC + Protobuf, reducing cluster CPU utilization by 28% and networking cost by $1.8M/yr.\n• Authored chaos engineering test suites simulating network partitions and disk stalls, verifying 100% deterministic failover recovery.",
