          "type": "text",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 622,
          "width": 710,
          "height": 105,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Architected high-throughput message streaming gateway in Go processing 2.4B events/day with end-to-end exactly-once delivery guarantees.\n• Deployed automated Kubernetes operator managing 3,500 stateful database pods, eliminating manual database failover interventions.\n• Implemented custom eBPF telemetry probes providing real-time socket tracking and catching TCP retransmission spikes before SLA breach.\n• Reduced P99 query latency on PostgreSQL read-replicas by 64% through optimal query index restructuring and connection pool tuning.",
          "fontSize": 11,
