          "type": "text",
          "x": 80,
          "y": 270,
          "width": 710,
          "height": 75,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "Staff Software Engineer with 11+ years architecting low-latency distributed storage engines, Raft-based consensus protocols, and large-scale cloud infrastructure. Built multi-region data platforms sustaining 450,000 QPS with sub-2ms p99 latency. Passionate about kernel-bypass networking (eBPF, io_uring), zero-allocation concurrency in Rust & Go, and high availability systems.",
