          "x": 80,
          "y": 792,
          "width": 710,
          "height": 85,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Developed high-speed columnar data ingestion worker pool in C++ and Python utilizing SIMD vectorization.\n• Created zero-copy ring-buffer shared memory IPC, speeding up inter-process data exchange by 4.2x.\n• Built automated CI/CD performance benchmarking pipeline flagging any pull request introducing >2% latency regression.",
