          "width": 710,
          "height": 105,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Direct research group of 12 Ph.D. research scientists developing novel RLHF algorithms (Direct Preference Optimization & Monte Carlo Tree Search).\n• Pretrained Nexus-Vision 34B multimodal foundation model, outperforming contemporary baselines on MMMU benchmark by 4.2 points.\n• Formulated kernel-level attention optimizations in Triton, reducing pretraining memory footprint by 32% and speeding up epoch wall-time by 1.4x.\n• Led red-teaming and safety alignment pipeline compliant with US AI Executive Order and EU AI Act standards.",
