          "text": "• Direct 18-person investment banking coverage team across North America Technology, Media, and Industrial sectors.\n• Generated $34M in annual advisory fee revenue across buy-side, sell-side, and debt capital markets mandates.\n• Drafted and delivered 12 board-level fairness opinions for contested public mergers with zero regulatory challenges.\n• Led quarterly investor briefings with sovereign wealth funds, pension endowments, and global asset managers.",
