          "height": 95,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Direct creative vision, visual identity, and global advertising campaigns for tier-1 luxury fashion houses including Chanel, Saint Laurent, and Cartier.\n• Lead multidisciplinary team of 26 art directors, fashion stylists, typographers, cinematographers, and digital spatial designers.\n• Conceived multi-platform digital vernissage generating 140M social impressions and 38% uplift in direct e-commerce boutique sales.\n• Commissioned world-renowned photographers and writers for bespoke hardbound collector's monographs distributed internationally.",
