        "visible": true,
        "text": "• Led development of HIPAA-compliant patient portal serving 1.2M active users in React, Next.js, and Node.js.\n• Designed end-to-end event-driven audit trail ensuring 100% compliance with SOC2 Type II and HITRUST requirements.\n• Optimized PostgreSQL query execution plans, indexing strategies, and read replicas, resolving chronic database connection pool exhaustion.\n• Implemented comprehensive automated testing suites in Jest and Cypress, elevating production code coverage from 58% to 91%.",
