          "y": 770,
          "width": 500,
          "height": 420,
          "text": "Offshore wind platforms directly coupled to seawater desalinators and PEM electrolyzers eliminate high-voltage AC grid transmission bottlenecks, converting raw gale power into dense storable molecules right at sea.\n\nSubsea pipelines shuttle gaseous hydrogen directly to coastal ports at five times the energy density of submarine electrical cables, demonstrating the decisive logistical edge of molecular energy carriers.",
